      "seed": 748797682,
      "version": 273,
      "versionNonce": 538200750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769927490903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But how does our frontend communicates with backend and the answer is through\nnetwork it's like sending message to your friend over internet via whatsapp\nsimilarly our frontend -> sends a request to backend over the network ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "But how does our frontend communicates with backend and the answer is through\nnetwork it's like sending message to your friend over internet via whatsapp\nsimilarly our frontend -> sends a request to backend over the network ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
