      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "this cannot\nsend request\nto the \nserver \ncause they are on different \nnetwork and we are accessing them \nvia private ip->So in order\nto access server we need \npublic ip which is provided\nby the isp->but a public ip\ncost alot of money  \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
