    {
      "id": "E2Tyn28ku11Bxgti32Hjw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 385.8468086308929,
      "y": 3543.067968352293,
      "width": 1001,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bpL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1576735342,
      "version": 201,
      "versionNonce": 209663662,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769929736066,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now one important thing to note is that when a frontend or and external service communicate\nwith our server it uses a protocol to communicate and that is HTTP protocol",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now one important thing to note is that when a frontend or and external service communicate\nwith our server it uses a protocol to communicate and that is HTTP protocol",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FUgXzBtyE8iLNvL-Vweaf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 389.45730998911426,
      "y": 3612.5619365798043,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bpM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 937943854,
      "version": 80,
      "versionNonce": 407136498,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769929755141,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In this protocol, the client will send a request to the server, that\nmight look something like the one below. In the example below, GET\nis simply a type of request, one of three we’ll discuss in this\ncourse. The / typically indicates that we’re looking for the\nwebsite’s home page, and the three dots indicate that we could be\npassing in more information as well.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In this protocol, the client will send a request to the server, that might look something like the one below. In the example below, GET is simply a type of request, one of three we’ll discuss in this course. The / typically indicates that we’re looking for the website’s home page, and the three dots indicate that we could be passing in more information as well.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XFyxpBlrNOkqnOCAJJVUi",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 389.0330335366298,
      "y": 3789.8634856444546,
      "width": 854.9589631327824,
      "height": 322.9844971834956,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bpN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641917870,
      "version": 86,
      "versionNonce": 2073643438,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769929771007,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "status": "saved",
      "fileId": "f2f1630888b2fe2e39405622e6da54b59e96594f",
      "scale": [
        1,
        1
      ],
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "luk5by2t99F4eX8u_rtWF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400.7870672277745,
      "y": 4139.904410658869,
      "width": 704,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bpO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 236915634,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 2027015086,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769929789374,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "After receiving a request, a server will then send back an HTTP\nresponse, which might look something like the one below. Such a\nresponse will include the HTTP version, a status code (200 means\nOK), a description of the content, and then some additional\ninformation.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After receiving a request, a server will then send back an HTTP response, which might look something like the one below. Such a response will include the HTTP version, a status code (200 means OK), a description of the content, and then some additional information.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
