    {
      "id": "A26ah1_gXYgk2OjgHDJ06",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 423.4116916960139,
      "y": 12328.470814627388,
      "width": 954.6032031857015,
      "height": 426.7297374963869,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bpy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1683270163,
      "version": 141,
      "versionNonce": 1071303325,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769931124660,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why Use Django Framework?\n\n-Rapid Development – It lets you build web apps quickly without having to code\neverything from scratch.\n\n-Built-in Features – User authentication, admin panel, ORM (database handling),\nforms, and security features come ready to use.\n\n-Scalability – Suitable for small projects as well as large, high-traffic\nwebsites (Instagram and Pinterest use Django).\n\n-Security – Protects against common attacks like SQL injection, cross-site\nscripting (XSS), and CSRF automatically.\n\n-Clean & Maintainable Code – Follows the MVT (Model-View-Template) pattern,\nmaking projects more organized",
      "fontSize": 21.336486874819347,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why Use Django Framework?\n\n-Rapid Development – It lets you build web apps quickly without having to code everything from scratch.\n\n-Built-in Features – User authentication, admin panel, ORM (database handling), forms, and security features come ready to use.\n\n-Scalability – Suitable for small projects as well as large, high-traffic websites (Instagram and Pinterest use Django).\n\n-Security – Protects against common attacks like SQL injection, cross-site scripting (XSS), and CSRF automatically.\n\n-Clean & Maintainable Code – Follows the MVT (Model-View-Template) pattern, making projects more organized",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kw7QwYxeRWwp9_axIasSs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 411.9298599510355,
      "y": 12877.222498139947,
      "width": 891,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
