      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769931707452,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now django is very much like Spring boot it's a server application rather \nserver itself like a spring boot app runs on tomcat server , django runs\non a wsgi or asgi server unlike express.js which uses node.js http module making \nit both a server app and a http server itself",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now django is very much like Spring boot it's a server application rather \nserver itself like a spring boot app runs on tomcat server , django runs\non a wsgi or asgi server unlike express.js which uses node.js http module making \nit both a server app and a http server itself",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "T8z2s29L9FJnvwgGKsNC8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 413.9333420617984,
      "y": 13026.259222257637,
      "width": 357.17139367657074,
      "height": 26.18558604666941,
