      "updated": 1769943093695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Templating:Templating is a way via which we can server frontend file from server\ntemplates are nothing but .html file incorporated with python code ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Templating:Templating is a way via which we can server frontend file from server\ntemplates are nothing but .html file incorporated with python code ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_VCBofMf2wNsdC_HhkH1c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 365.16946452388424,
      "y": 24236.10352248041,
      "width": 737,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "br5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 690959854,
      "version": 86,
      "versionNonce": 1124957362,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769943120983,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Templates\nSo far, our HTTP Responses, have been only text, but we can include\nany HTML elements we want to! For example, I could decide to return\na blue header instead of just the text in our index function:\n\ndef index(request):\n    return HttpResponse(\"<h1 style=\\\"color:blue\\\">Hello, world!\n</h1>\")",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Templates\nSo far, our HTTP Responses, have been only text, but we can include any HTML elements we want to! For example, I could decide to return a blue header instead of just the text in our index function:\n\ndef index(request):\n    return HttpResponse(\"<h1 style=\\\"color:blue\\\">Hello, world!</h1>\")",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
