      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769943783678,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now, we’ll need to create that template. To do this, we’ll create a\nfolder called templates inside our app, then create a folder called\nhello (or whatever our app’s name is) within that, and then add a\nfile called index.html.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now, we’ll need to create that template. To do this, we’ll create a folder called templates inside our app, then create a folder called hello (or whatever our app’s name is) within that, and then add a file called index.html.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
