      "seed": 1132409262,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 1583379186,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769944395823,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now, let’s create our index.html template. We’ll have to again\ncreate a new folder called templates, a folder within that called\nnewyear, and a file within that called index.html. Inside that file,\nwe’ll write something like this:\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <title>Is it New Year's?</title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        {% if newyear -%}\n            <h1>YES</h1>\n        {%- else -%}\n            <h1>NO</h1>\n        {%- endif %}\n    </body>\n</html>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now, let’s create our index.html template. We’ll have to again create a new folder called templates, a folder within that called newyear, and a file within that called index.html. Inside that file, we’ll write something like this:\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <title>Is it New Year's?</title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        {% if newyear -%}\n            <h1>YES</h1>\n        {%- else -%}\n            <h1>NO</h1>\n        {%- endif %}\n    </body>\n</html>",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
